5.760" end="00:15.940">for </span><span begin="00:15.940" end="00:16.570">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.620" end="00:20.800"><span begin="00:17.620" end="00:18.730">Oh </span><span begin="00:18.730" end="00:18.970">I </span><span begin="00:18.970" end="00:19.270">don't </span><span begin="00:19.270" end="00:19.660">need </span><span begin="00:19.660" end="00:19.780">a </span><span begin="00:19.780" end="00:20.140">hand </span><span begin="00:20.140" end="00:20.230">to </span><span begin="00:20.230" end="00:20.800">hold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.860" end="00:22.870"><span begin="00:20.860" end="00:21.400">Even </span><span begin="00:21.400" end="00:21.760">when </span><span begin="00:21.760" end="00:21.940">the </span><span begin="00:21.940" end="00:22.210">night </span><span begin="00:22.210" end="00:22.390">is </span><span begin="00:22.390" end="00:22.870">cold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.960" end="00:25.150"><span begin="00:22.960" end="00:23.050">I </span><span begin="00:23.050" end="00:23.320">got </span><span begin="00:23.320" end="00:23.560">that </span><span begin="00:23.560" end="00:24.130">fire </span><span begin="00:24.130" end="00:24.280">in </span><span begin="00:24.280" end="00:24.430">my </span><span begin="00:24.430" end="00:25.150">soul</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.680" end="00:29.080"><span begin="00:26.680" end="00:26.890">And </span><span begin="00:26.890" end="00:27.040">as </span><span begin="00:27.040" end="00:27.250">far </span><span begin="00:27.250" end="00:27.370">as </span><span begin="00:27.370" end="00:27.490">I </span><span begin="00:27.490" end="00:27.640">can </span><span begin="00:27.640" end="00:27.910">see </span><span begin="00:27.910" end="00:28.030">I </span><span begin="00:28.030" end="00:28.240">just </span><span begin="00:28.240" end="00:28.390">need </span><span begin="00:28.390" end="00:29.080">privacy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.350" end="00:31.660"><span begin="00:29.350" end="00:29.710">Plus </span><span begin="00:29.710" end="00:29.800">a </span><span begin="00:29.800" end="00:29.980">whole </span><span begin="00:29.980" end="00:30.220">lot </span><span begin="00:30.220" end="00:30.310">of </span><span begin="00:30.310" end="00:30.520">tree</span><span begin="00:30.520" end="00:30.570">, </span><span begin="00:30.570" end="00:30.620">*</span><span begin="00:30.620" end="00:30.670">*</span><span begin="00:30.670" end="00:30.720">*</span><span begin="00:30.720" end="00:30.790">* </span><span begin="00:30.790" end="00:30.910">all </span><span begin="00:30.910" end="00:31.090">this </span><span begin="00:31.090" end="00:31.660">modesty</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.660" end="00:34.300"><span begin="00:31.660" end="00:31.750">I </span><span begin="00:31.750" end="00:31.990">just </span><span begin="00:31.990" end="00:32.110">need </span><span begin="00:32.110" end="00:32.380">space </span><span begin="00:32.380" end="00:32.470">to </span><span begin="00:32.470" end="00:32.650">do </span><span begin="00:32.650" end="00:32.920">me </span><span begin="00:32.920" end="00:33.100">get </span><span begin="00:33.100" end="00:33.160">a </span><span begin="00:33.160" end="00:33.430">world </span><span begin="00:33.430" end="00:33.520">that </span><span begin="00:33.520" end="00:33.670">they're </span><span begin="00:33.670" end="00:34.030">tryna </span><span begin="00:34.030" end="00:34.300">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.660" end="00:36.460"><span begin="00:34.660" end="00:34.750">A </span><span begin="00:34.750" end="00:35.170">Stella </span><span begin="00:35.170" end="00:35.590">Maxwell </span><span begin="00:35.590" end="00:35.770">right </span><span begin="00:35.770" end="00:36.190">beside </span><span begin="00:36.190" end="00:36.250">of </span><span begin="00:36.250" end="00:36.460">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.700" end="00:38.200"><span begin="00:36.700" end="00:36.790">A </span><span begin="00:36.790" end="00:37.390">Ferrari </span><span begin="00:37.390" end="00:37.510">I'm </span><span begin="00:37.510" end="00:37.810">buyin' </span><span begin="00:37.810" end="00:38.200">three</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.440" end="00:40.930"><span begin="00:38.440" end="00:38.560">A </span><span begin="00:38.560" end="00:39.010">closet </span><span begin="00:39.010" end="00:39.070">of </span><span begin="00:39.070" end="00:39.370">Saint </span><span begin="00:39.370" end="00:39.700">Laurent</span><span begin="00:39.700" end="00:39.700">, </span><span begin="00:39.700" end="00:39.880">get </span><span begin="00:39.880" end="00:40.060">what </span><span begin="00:40.060" end="00:40.150">I </span><span begin="00:40.150" end="00:40.420">want </span><span begin="00:40.420" end="00:40.630">when </span><span begin="00:40.630" end="00:40.720">I </span><span begin="00:40.720" end="00:40.930">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.930" end="00:42.880"><span begin="00:40.930" end="00:41.110">Cause </span><span begin="00:41.110" end="00:41.290">this </span><span begin="00:41.290" end="00:41.620">hunger </span><span begin="00:41.620" end="00:41.830">is </span><span begin="00:41.830" end="00:42.190">driving </span><span begin="00:42.190" end="00:42.340">me</span><span begin="00:42.340" end="00:42.340">, </span><span begin="00:42.340" end="00:42.880">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.210" end="00:46.180"><span begin="00:43.210" end="00:43.390">I </span><span begin="00:43.390" end="00:43.680">just </span><span begin="00:43.680" end="00:43.890">need </span><span begin="00:43.890" end="00:43.980">to </span><span begin="00:43.980" end="00:44.140">be </span><span begin="00:44.140" end="00:44.650">alone</span><span begin="00:44.650" end="00:44.830">, </span><span begin="00:44.830" end="00:44.980">I </span><span begin="00:44.980" end="00:45.280">just </span><span begin="00:45.280" end="00:45.430">need </span><span begin="00:45.430" end="00:45.