.430" end="00:54.670">just </span><span begin="00:54.670" end="00:55.030">make </span><span begin="00:55.030" end="00:55.450">M's</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.540" end="00:57.580"><span begin="00:55.540" end="00:55.780">While </span><span begin="00:55.780" end="00:56.080">y'all </span><span begin="00:56.080" end="00:56.500">follow</span><span begin="00:56.500" end="00:56.500">, </span><span begin="00:56.500" end="00:56.650">we </span><span begin="00:56.650" end="00:56.890">just </span><span begin="00:56.890" end="00:57.160">make </span><span begin="00:57.160" end="00:57.580">trends</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.580" end="01:00.160"><span begin="00:57.580" end="00:57.670">I'm </span><span begin="00:57.670" end="00:57.880">right </span><span begin="00:57.880" end="00:58.150">back </span><span begin="00:58.150" end="00:58.300">to </span><span begin="00:58.300" end="00:58.570">work </span><span begin="00:58.570" end="00:58.750">when </span><span begin="00:58.750" end="00:58.960">that </span><span begin="00:58.960" end="00:59.410">break </span><span begin="00:59.410" end="01:00.160">ends</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.520" end="01:03.640"><span begin="01:00.520" end="01:01.540">Oh</span><span begin="01:01.540" end="01:01.570">, </span><span begin="01:01.570" end="01:01.900">it's </span><span begin="01:01.900" end="01:02.170">just </span><span begin="01:02.170" end="01:02.380">me</span><span begin="01:02.380" end="01:02.380">, </span><span begin="01:02.380" end="01:03.010">myself </span><span begin="01:03.010" end="01:03.190">and </span><span begin="01:03.190" end="01:03.640">I</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.640" end="01:05.830"><span begin="01:03.640" end="01:04.240">Solo </span><span begin="01:04.240" end="01:04.630">ride </span><span begin="01:04.630" end="01:05.050">until </span><span begin="01:05.050" end="01:05.200">I </span><span begin="01:05.200" end="01:05.830">die</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.860" end="01:07.840"><span begin="01:05.860" end="01:06.220">Cause </span><span begin="01:06.220" end="01:06.640">I </span><span begin="01:06.640" end="01:07.000">got </span><span begin="01:07.000" end="01:07.210">me </span><span begin="01:07.210" end="01:07.360">for </span><span begin="01:07.360" end="01:07.840">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.840" end="01:09.070"><span begin="01:07.840" end="01:07.870">（</span><span begin="01:07.870" end="01:08.080">Got </span><span begin="01:08.080" end="01:08.290">me </span><span begin="01:08.290" end="01:08.470">for </span><span begin="01:08.470" end="01:08.980">life</span><span begin="01:08.980" end="01:08.980">, </span><span begin="01:08.980" end="01:09.040">yeah</span><span begin="01:09.040" end="01:09.070">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.070" end="01:12.280"><span begin="01:09.070" end="01:10.150">Oh </span><span begin="01:10.150" end="01:10.390">I </span><span begin="01:10.390" end="01:10.690">don't </span><span begin="01:10.690" end="01:11.080">need </span><span begin="01:11.080" end="01:11.230">a </span><span begin="01:11.230" end="01:11.560">hand </span><span begin="01:11.560" end="01:11.650">to </span><span begin="01:11.650" end="01:12.280">hold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.310" end="01:14.290"><span begin="01:12.310" end="01:12.850">Even </span><span begin="01:12.850" end="01:13.180">when </span><span begin="01:13.180" end="01:13.360">the </span><span begin="01:13.360" end="01:13.660">night </span><span begin="01:13.660" end="01:13.810">is </span><span begin="01:13.810" end="01:14.290">cold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.380" end="01:16.870"><span begin="01:14.380" end="01:14.470">I </span><span begin="01:14.470" end="01:14.740">got </span><span begin="01:14.740" end="01:14.980">that </span><span begin="01:14.980" end="01:15.550">fire </span><span begin="01:15.550" end="01:15.730">in </span><span begin="01:15.730" end="01:15.880">my </span><span begin="01:15.880" end="01:16.870">soul</s